# Auto detect text files and perform LF normalization.
#
# The explicit `eol=lf` entries below exist to silence the warning, not to change behaviour: `text=auto`
# already normalises on checkin, and git announced that conversion for all ninety-six generated icons on
# every commit, which buried anything worth reading in the output.
* text=auto

*.json text eol=lf
*.mjs  text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.svg  text eol=lf
*.webp binary
*.png  binary
